\li1 \rb Mebunnai|מְבֻנַּ֖י\rb*\f + \fr 23:27 \ft Hebrew; some LXX manuscripts \fqa Sibbecai\ft ; see 2 Samuel 21:18 and 1 Chronicles 11:29.\f* \rb the Hushathite|הַחֻשָׁתִֽי׃ס\rb*,
\li1 \v 28 \rb Zalmon|צַלְמוֹן֙\rb* \rb the Ahohite|הָֽאֲחֹחִ֔י\rb*,
